.TH CALCULATEUR-MASQUES 1 "2026-10-25" "1.0.1" "Calculateur de Masques IPv4"
.SH NAME
calculateur-masques \- IPv4 subnet mask calculator (graphical)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B calculateur-masques
[\fB\-\-lang\fR \fICODE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Offline graphical utility to calculate IPv4 subnet masks, split a network into subnets, keep a history and export it as CSV or text. The interface is available in 15 languages.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-lang " " \fICODE\fR
Start in the given interface language: fr, en, es, pt, it, sr, pl, hu, ru, hi, zh, vi, ko, ja or fil. The language is not remembered between sessions.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/fonts/calculateur-masques/
Korean font downloaded on request from the font dialog (removed by deleting the folder and running fc-cache -f).
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/harlockSuites/CalculateurMasques/tree/Linux
